 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "The genus of a curve",
 "statement": "Let $k$ be a field and let $X$ be a\nsmooth projective curve over\n$k$ which is geometrically\nirreducible. The *genus* of $X$ is\n\n$$\ng(X):=\\dim_kH^1(X,\\mathcal{O}_X)\\in\\Z_{\\geq0}\n$$\n\n(Stacks Project, Picard Schemes of Curves, Definition 44.6.3, Tag\n[0B9W](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0B9W)).",
